;;; To try out this example, evaluate the entire code snippet and type:        ;;;
;;;                                                                            ;;;
;;;     M-x year-calendar                                                      ;;;
;;;                                                                            ;;;
;;; To scroll forward by month, type the key:  >                               ;;;
